<title>USA: First Empire State Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>First Empire State Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31		1997	1996  Change</p>
<p> Net interest income		     $136,445   129,592    5%</p>
